aurant for my birthday."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to chat with colleagues."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get to know each other"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to know more about each other from spending time together"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: John and Sandra go out for coffee to get to know each other."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be in charge of"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have control of or responsibility for something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sandra will be in charge of all the tours in the Caribbean."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "excursion"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a short trip for fun"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: On a cruise, it's fun to take an excursion off the ship."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to coordinate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to plan and manage details"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sandra's job is to coordinate the tours on all the ships."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le07ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to transfer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to change from one workplace to another"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If the company transfers Sandra, she may work in the city."}